This product includes eval records derived from third-party datasets:

  * Behavioral Constraints (BC, 250 records) — derived from
    fka/prompts.chat, licensed CC0-1.0 (public domain dedication).

  * Benign Baseline (BN, 250 records) — derived from tatsu-lab/alpaca
    (Taori et al., "Stanford Alpaca: An Instruction-following LLaMA
    model", 2023), licensed CC BY-NC 4.0.

    NOTE: CC BY-NC 4.0 permits NON-COMMERCIAL use only. That restriction
    applies to the BN records regardless of the Apache-2.0 licence
    covering this project's code. See DATA_CARD.md.

  * Indirect prompt injection corpus (data/xpia_corpus.parquet, 25,002 rows) —
    derived from three agent-injection benchmarks, each under its own
    upstream terms:
      - BIPIA               (https://github.com/microsoft/BIPIA)
      - LLMail-Inject       (https://huggingface.co/datasets/microsoft/llmail-inject-challenge)
      - InjecAgent          (https://github.com/uiuc-kang-lab/InjecAgent)
    The taxonomy tagging layer is this project's; the prompts are not.

The Adversarial Prompt (AP) and Hidden Objective (HO) records were
generated for this project and are covered by the Apache-2.0 licence.
